Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.64,0:00:04.44,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\bord0\b1\c&H1E292B&\frz342.5\move(292,-70,292,105.333,0,3800)\frx346\fry334}Nasu Oyaji Curry
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.14,0:00:08.11,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,The Kobe trip ended safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.11,0:00:10.76,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,And summer break\Nwas nearing its end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.34,0:00:13.56,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Casual clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.95,0:00:17.41,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Chinatown. Sun parasol and pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:20.12,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,The aquarium...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.91,0:00:23.65,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,The scent of Senpai's shampoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.61,0:00:28.12,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Holding hands, and having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.95,0:00:34.43,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,More and more, it's becoming not enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:36.73,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Yoi! Yoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.14,0:00:38.18,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Yoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:39.85,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,The rice! The rice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.85,0:00:40.66,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.58,0:00:46.02,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,The rice...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.59,0:02:18.22,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Oh, man...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.45,0:02:21.91,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,It's surprisingly slow today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.34,0:02:26.79,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Maybe I should ask Asami to \Nbring her college friends over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.79,0:02:29.01,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I think Sis would be pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.01,0:02:30.98,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Yep, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.98,0:02:33.10,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Oh, how about the kids \Nat your school, Yoi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.10,0:02:35.06,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,You know! That boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.74,0:02:38.72,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,The curry fanatic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:41.54,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.54,0:02:43.40,italics,SENTARO,0,0,0,,I'm the curry fanatic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.47,0:02:46.75,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Business sure is slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.62,0:02:51.29,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I haven't seen Senpai\Nsince the Kobe trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.01,0:02:54.68,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I've been busy with this and that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.81,0:02:57.01,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,If I'd known this would happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:02:59.58,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I would have kept my schedule \Nopen a little more...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.83,0:03:03.25,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Welcome...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.71,0:03:04.42,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.67,0:03:06.67,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:09.72,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What brought this on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.72,0:03:12.44,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Just came by to eat curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.81,0:03:14.12,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Can I sit anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:15.79,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, please, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.08,0:03:23.54,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So, I'd like one special. Large.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.51,0:03:28.98,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, he really did just \Ncome here for curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.73,0:03:28.98,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Uh, and for my drink...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:30.48,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,iced coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:31.44,Default,DAD; YOI,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.72,0:03:32.77,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.77,0:03:33.57,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:35.19,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.51,0:03:40.01,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I was passing by, so I figured \NI'd stop by for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.01,0:03:42.05,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Yeah, come in and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.02,0:03:45.57,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.58,0:03:48.39,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:03:57.42,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs24\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\b1\an5\c&H231F32&\t(1151,1234,\c&HD8FFFE&)\frx18\fry20\frz346.1\pos(330,189.333)}Nasu Oyaji {\t(1151,1234,\c&H94B0D0&)}Curry
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.81,0:03:59.29,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Thanks for the grub.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.77,0:04:04.37,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Yoi, can you handle the register?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.37,0:04:05.35,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.87,0:04:07.10,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,One moment, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.47,0:04:11.43,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um, one large special. \NAnd the drink was...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.43,0:04:13.89,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H67667A&\frz45.49\pos(439.999,245.334)\frx20\fry304}Nasu {\c&H7E86A2&}Oyaji {\c&H9097C0&}Curry
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:13.89,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.22,0:04:16.59,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It was real good as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.34,0:04:19.80,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I've \Nhad something nourishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.80,0:04:21.00,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.00,0:04:22.79,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You keep eating from\Nthe convenience store...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.27,0:04:25.69,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Don't you ever go back \Nto your parents' house to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.24,0:04:29.06,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What? No way. It's a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.46,0:04:32.52,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Besides, don't you ever get the \Nurge to eat junk food for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.89,0:04:34.75,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Like burgers and takoyaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.75,0:04:36.81,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, takoyaki... That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.81,0:04:39.74,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'd like to eat a whole bunch for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.74,0:04:41.01,top,YOI,0,0,0,,I wonder how many I could eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.97,0:04:42.46,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What are you imagining right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.01,0:04:42.46,top,YOI,0,0,0,,Maybe ten?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.81,0:04:44.43,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Burgers are good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:47.56,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh... a takoyaki burger...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.26,0:04:50.43,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Then, wanna have a takoyaki party\N date sometime?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.93,0:04:52.81,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,At my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:54.74,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,His place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.05,0:05:00.02,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, don't freeze up on me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.25,0:05:03.72,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I-Is that what this was leading to?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:06.82,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I thought we were just making \Nsmall talk after the curry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:06.91,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Y'know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:10.73,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Can't you stop, think, and realize\N that I came to see you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.12,0:05:15.18,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,For the record, I {\i1}am{\i0} inviting you over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.74,0:05:25.34,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh... Um... I-If...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:28.66,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,If my schedule frees up, \NI'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:33.25,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, come on. Let's be \Na little more proactive here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.25,0:05:35.18,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But I have work and other things...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.11,0:05:45.57,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs10\bord0\c&HBFC6B3&\frx34\fry348\frz58.25\pos(308.666,143.999)}Nobara-chan
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.21,0:05:47.70,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Nobara-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:48.95,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Did you finish your homework?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.71,0:05:52.68,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.37,0:05:55.86,italics,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, good! Me neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:57.98,italics,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Do you think Yoi-chan got it done?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.98,0:06:00.43,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,The Prince? I'm sure she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.13,0:06:03.90,Default,KOTOBUKI AND NOBARA,0,0,0,,That's right! Yoi-chan-sama would!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.90,0:06:05.82,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,By the way, about Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.82,0:06:07.34,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Don't you think she seemed like
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.34,0:06:10.05,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,she was getting along with Senpai \Nreal well when we were in Kobe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.05,0:06:11.26,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Oh, I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.26,0:06:14.92,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,She just might be meeting \Nup with Senpai as we speak...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:20.06,Default,STORE CLERK,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.08,0:06:22.90,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Oh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:24.39,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:33.13,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Are things with the Prince going well?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.19,0:06:37.81,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,You're such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.81,0:06:38.97,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Oh, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.61,0:06:42.13,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,I was wondering whatever \Nhappened to that dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.63,0:06:46.38,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Y'know, the part-timer?\NThe handsome guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.38,0:06:50.69,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, beats me.\NI think he still works there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:52.05,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Don't know, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.43,0:06:54.75,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.17,0:06:57.02,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:58.60,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Well, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.57,0:07:03.48,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,That guy seemed like he had \Nhis eyes on the Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.18,0:07:07.46,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Like they had some real \Nchemistry, or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.49,0:07:11.38,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Well, I might just be \Noverthinking it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.38,0:07:12.26,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Kuwa...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:12.95,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:15.85,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Don't drop weird hints at me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.45,0:07:19.26,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,My bad. My bad.\NDon't take it seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.26,0:07:23.69,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,First of all, there's no way anything \Nlike that would happen with Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.69,0:07:25.23,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Well, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.23,0:07:27.69,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,But what if something {\i1}were{\i0} to...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.94,0:07:31.08,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Kuwa! Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.08,0:07:33.26,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,My bad, my bad! I'm kiddin'! I'm kiddin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:35.36,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Why ya little... Take that! And that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:37.14,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Hey, stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.91,0:07:39.02,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,At my place...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.29,0:07:44.75,Default,TWIN'S VOICE,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan, Yoi-chan, Yoi-chan-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.75,0:07:45.11,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.39,0:07:46.98,Default,TWINS,0,0,0,,We solved the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:51.58,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, then you think you \Ncould solve this next one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.90,0:07:56.01,top,YOI,0,0,0,,For this problem, you apply this part of\N the problem we just did, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.98,0:07:55.39,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,If we're going to be at\N his house alone together...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.74,0:07:58.77,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Are we going to kiss... and stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.01,0:07:59.00,top,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, yeah. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.62,0:08:07.09,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,No, we're there to have takoyaki! Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.15,0:08:10.60,Default,TWIN 1,0,0,0,,Sensei's weird today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:11.55,Default,TWIN 2,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.74,0:08:15.51,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I can't picture it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.23,0:08:17.97,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I wonder what it's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.28,0:08:21.09,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.09,0:08:22.98,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Like I said, we're there \Nto have takoyaki...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.03,0:08:27.99,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Besides, it's not like my schedule is \Ngoing to conveniently free up anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:38.37,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord0\fs14\fnComic Sans MS\c&HFDF9FE&\pos(358,42.666)\frz343.5\frx344\fry340}Nasu Oyaji Curry
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.37,0:08:40.33,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord0\fs15\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&HCDC3A9&\pos(16,50)}We apologize for the inconvenience,\Nbut we will be temporarily closed today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.37,0:08:40.33,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\shad0\blur1\p1\fscy220\alpha&H50&\c&H647794&\3c&HF8D6AE&\4c&HB7775D&}m 0 0 l 220 0 220 16 0 16
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.77,0:08:43.29,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.29,0:08:46.68,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? What did you get? \NA winning lottery ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:48.70,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,No! I got food poisoning!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.70,0:08:52.26,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Was it the meal set I had for lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:56.72,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,For now, I'm going to the hospital, \Nso close up the shop for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:08:59.73,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,You two can take today off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.73,0:09:03.86,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Make sure you lock the doors \Nand turn off the gas and lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.47,0:09:09.13,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I guess we'll close up shop \Nand go home for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.13,0:09:10.40,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:15.23,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,My schedule... is freed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.84,0:09:19.13,flashback,YOI,0,0,0,,If my schedule frees up, \NI'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:25.24,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Since I was the one who said that, I \Nshould be the one to contact him... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.78,0:09:28.06,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,But if I do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.06,0:09:29.13,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Um.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.91,0:09:35.41,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Do you have some free time right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.26,0:09:43.48,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for putting you through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:47.69,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No worries. They put my dad on an \NIV drip so he's all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.45,0:09:52.19,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I did promise to help you pick \Nout a present for your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.71,0:09:53.65,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.28,0:09:55.64,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:57.95,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'll meet with Senpai another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.39,0:10:01.61,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,By the way, how old is \Nyour younger sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.61,0:10:02.65,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,She's in third grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.65,0:10:04.49,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Third grade, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.49,0:10:06.13,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I wonder what she'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.51,0:10:10.46,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,What did you want at that age, Yoi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:15.23,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um... I was taking karate back then, \Nso something like a sports bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.23,0:10:17.92,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Or a face towel. \NThat would make me really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.92,0:10:19.89,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh, I know what you mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:21.64,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I was into soccer, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.64,0:10:24.81,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,That sort of thing does make \Nyou happy, like a sports bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.81,0:10:26.08,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Nice one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:26.59,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:34.14,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Do you want to check it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.54,0:11:08.33,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I kept buying things for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:09.91,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,No, same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.91,0:11:12.73,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,We kind of got distracted, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.65,0:11:15.43,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Let's just look it up on online.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:19.15,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fs15\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H1E1B1F&\frx10\fry2\frz341.1\pos(340.667,176.666)}Hair accessories
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:19.15,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fs10\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H1E1B1F&\frx10\fry2\frz341.1\pos(226.667,216.666)}Cute stationary
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:19.15,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fs10\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H1E1B1F&\frx10\fry2\frz341.1\pos(312,246.666)}Toys
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:16.27,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fs10\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H1E1B1F&\frx10\fry2\frz341.1\pos(390,273.333)}Clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.27,0:11:16.40,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fs10\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H1E1B1F&\frx10\fry2\frz341.1\pos(390,273.333)\clip(m 368 263 l 394 274 398 286 402 297 374 287)}Clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:16.53,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fs10\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H1E1B1F&\frx10\fry2\frz341.1\pos(390,273.333)\clip(m 374 266 l 384 284 371 288 356 277)}Clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:19.15,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fs10\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H1E1B1F&\frx10\fry2\frz341.1\pos(252.334,287.333)}Play makeup
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:19.15,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fs10\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H1E1B1F&\frx10\fry2\frz341.1\pos(331.333,315.333)}Watches
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:19.15,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\fs15\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H49524D&\3c&HE7AEE1&\frx10\fry2\pos(386,29.334)\frz341.1}Elementary School Girl Present{\c&H3D363E&}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:19.15,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\bord1.5\b1\fs10\c&HE8EAE9&\3c&HCC7CCA&\frx10\fry2\frz341.1\pos(345.333,136)}Top 6 things to give to an elementary school girl
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.74,0:11:17.30,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:22.34,Default,YOI and OJI,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:26.36,Default,STORE CLERK,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.35,0:11:32.90,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Seems like it was just faster \Nto look it up, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.90,0:11:34.58,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.58,0:11:35.92,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Well then, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.05,0:11:38.71,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Uh... Um!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:43.41,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Would you like to stop\N by one more place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:50.93,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:52.52,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Paying for my treat...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:54.11,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,It's the least I could do to say thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:55.14,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.73,0:11:57.42,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.90,0:12:00.04,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I didn't have anyone else \NI could ask about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:01.81,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,so you really helped me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.81,0:12:03.70,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I've been wondering about \Nthis for a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.00,0:12:06.66,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Don't you have a girlfriend \Nor something, Oji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.37,0:12:10.62,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,N-No, not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:11.97,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You seem like you'd be popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.97,0:12:13.27,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I-I'm not popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.27,0:12:15.10,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I go to an all-boys school, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.10,0:12:16.33,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.71,0:12:22.84,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I spend a lot of time playing sports, \Nso I'm not used to being around girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:26.68,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I'm never sure what to talk about, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.14,0:12:29.74,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Even in folk dancing, I couldn't bring \Nmyself to take a girl's hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:31.56,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:33.71,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.89,0:12:36.67,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You can't look them in the eye, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.67,0:12:37.43,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.43,0:12:39.22,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Also, I'd end up using \Nhonorifics the whole time,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:43.00,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,and since I'm not used to it, my \Nspeech comes across really cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:44.04,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.04,0:12:44.91,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.63,0:12:49.91,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,We have lots in common, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:54.36,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,So, do you like anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.65,0:12:57.69,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.07,0:13:01.86,Default,IGUCHI,0,0,0,,Huh, Takuto?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.86,0:13:02.97,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Iguchi, Taoka!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.97,0:13:04.89,Default,IGUCHI,0,0,0,,Didn't you say you had work today?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.37,0:13:07.03,Default,IGUCHI,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:10.05,Default,IGUCHI,0,0,0,,Hey, are you a {\i1}girl{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.64,0:13:14.15,Default,IGUCHI,0,0,0,,And here I thought he was \Nwalking with a really handsome guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.15,0:13:16.38,Default,TAOKA?,0,0,0,,Whoa, no kiddin'! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.38,0:13:17.27,Default,IGUCHI,0,0,0,,You look so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.27,0:13:19.73,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Hey, that's rude, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.77,0:13:23.80,Default,IGUCHI,0,0,0,,Oh, right, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.80,0:13:24.71,Default,TAOKA,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.71,0:13:27.02,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, no, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.02,0:13:28.11,Default,IGUCHI,0,0,0,,I'm seriously sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.11,0:13:30.62,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No, really, don't worry \Nabout it. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.15,0:13:38.33,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.83,0:13:40.73,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,About what happened back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.73,0:13:43.05,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,My friends were being rude to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.05,0:13:43.96,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.22,0:13:47.81,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No, really, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.21,0:13:50.60,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm used to it. Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.60,0:13:52.66,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I used to be self-conscious about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.66,0:13:55.52,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,but now it doesn't bother me as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.67,0:14:02.39,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Was there something particular \Nthat helped you with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.31,0:14:09.77,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,The thing that helped me was...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.91,0:14:22.25,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,For the first time ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.13,0:14:27.99,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,someone treated me like a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.11,0:14:39.99,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.99,0:14:42.11,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Honestly, what am I even saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.11,0:14:43.48,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Please forget what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.81,0:14:47.61,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Yoi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:50.53,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,You have cream on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.11,0:14:52.50,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh, oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:54.08,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh, on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:54.91,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.73,0:14:58.66,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.75,0:15:01.19,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:02.21,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.11,0:15:07.92,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Didn't... something like \Nthis happen before?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.38,0:15:11.64,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,The lassi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.01,0:15:18.62,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for doing that every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.98,0:15:28.69,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I do have someone I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.95,0:15:30.91,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.93,0:15:56.92,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I saw you as a girl right \Nfrom the start, Yoi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.33,0:16:13.39,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Well, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.22,0:16:30.92,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.53,0:16:34.19,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.18,0:16:44.92,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.38,0:17:07.32,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,That was the very first time I ever \Nthought someone was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.55,0:17:14.42,flashback italics,OJI,0,0,0,,Huh? Did it shrink again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.78,0:17:17.72,flashback,PHYSICIAN (FEMALE IN 50s),0,0,0,,177.9 cm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:19.18,flashback,PHYSICIAN (FEMALE IN 50s),0,0,0,,My you're growing so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.18,0:17:21.78,flashback,PHYSICIAN (FEMALE IN 50s),0,0,0,,In one year, you've grown more than 10 cm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.78,0:17:23.42,flashback,MALE CLASSMATE,0,0,0,,You're lucky, Oji.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.42,0:17:25.32,flashback,MALE CLASSMATE,0,0,0,,I wanna be tall, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.07,0:17:27.81,flashback,MALE CLASSMATE,0,0,0,,Hey, it went that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.81,0:17:29.48,flashback,MALE CLASSMATE,0,0,0,,Hey, over here, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.01,0:17:34.34,flashback,GIRL 1,0,0,0,,Hey, don't you think Oji's a hottie?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:38.20,flashback,GIRL 2,0,0,0,,I know, right? He's really \Nstanding out lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.57,0:17:40.43,flashback,GIRL 3,0,0,0,,He had a cute face to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.43,0:17:42.46,flashback,GIRL 3,0,0,0,,Don't you think he has \Nthe best-looking face?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.46,0:17:44.77,flashback,GIRL 1,0,0,0,,He doesn't really talk to girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.77,0:17:46.62,flashback,GIRL 1,0,0,0,,But he seems like he has his act together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.62,0:17:47.96,flashback,GIRL 2,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.46,0:17:51.71,flashback,BOY 1,0,0,0,,Takuto, let's go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.71,0:17:52.92,flashback,OJI,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.41,0:17:55.60,flashback,OJI,0,0,0,,Hey, did you see that \Nsoccer match yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.60,0:17:56.61,flashback,GIRL A,0,0,0,,Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:18:00.37,flashback,GIRL A,0,0,0,,Can we walk home with you guys, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:18:00.85,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fs15\fnComic Sans MS\c&HB2B2A7&\frx356\fry0\pos(543.333,108.666)}Day Duty
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:18:00.85,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fs15\fnComic Sans MS\c&HB2B2A7&\pos(531.333,180)\frx356\fry0}Hasegawa\NHonda
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.85,0:18:03.81,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord0\fs10\c&H141B22&\frz335.1\pos(144,324)\frx12\fry12}Caution
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.06,0:18:05.68,flashback,GIRL A,0,0,0,,What, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.68,0:18:06.76,flashback,GIRL A,0,0,0,,That was amazing, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.76,0:18:08.63,flashback,BOY 1,0,0,0,,Oh, which reminds me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.63,0:18:12.71,flashback italics,OJI,0,0,0,,Aw, man, I wanted to talk about \Nstupid stuff like we usually do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.30,0:18:14.19,flashback,OJI,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:18.28,flashback,OJI,0,0,0,,I'm this way, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.11,0:18:21.99,flashback,GIRL A,0,0,0,,I'm that way, too.\NCan I walk with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.69,0:18:37.41,flashback italics,OJI,0,0,0,,What should I talk about \Nat times like these?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.41,0:18:38.15,flashback,GIRL A,0,0,0,,Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.15,0:18:38.80,flashback,OJI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.14,0:18:42.01,flashback,GIRL A,0,0,0,,What do guys usually talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.01,0:18:44.12,flashback,OJI,0,0,0,,Uh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:46.84,flashback,OJI,0,0,0,,We talk about club activities, \Nmanga, and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.84,0:18:48.74,flashback,OJI,0,0,0,,And sometimes videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:50.21,flashback,GIRL A,0,0,0,,Huh, what kind of videos?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.21,0:18:54.23,flashback,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh... Mainly soccer commentaries \Nand overseas reaction videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.46,0:18:58.23,flashback,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh, there's this one channel that's \Nall about Indian food stalls...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.23,0:19:01.71,flashback,OJI,0,0,0,,People making tons of fried rice, \Nor putting toppers on cakes...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.71,0:19:04.13,flashback,OJI,0,0,0,,There's just always something\N amazing happening...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.86,0:19:08.27,flashback,GIRL A,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.45,0:19:11.98,flashback italics,OJI,0,0,0,,Th-This is so awkward...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.47,0:19:16.74,flashback,GIRL 4,0,0,0,,Even his name, "Oji," makes \Nhim sound like a prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.74,0:19:17.32,flashback,GIRL 5,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.32,0:19:18.59,flashback,GIRL 6,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.85,0:19:21.77,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,No matter how tall I grew \Nor how my appearance changed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.77,0:19:27.06,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,I was still the same guy inside, playing\Nsoccer and hanging with the guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.31,0:19:29.42,flashback,GIRL 7,0,0,0,,Oji, you should come hang \Nwith us, too, next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.42,0:19:31.62,flashbacktop,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh, I have club activities, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.91,0:19:34.27,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,And yet, the reaction from those \Naround me gradually changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.13,0:19:36.48,flashback,OJI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.48,0:19:39.80,flashbacktop,OJI,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in having \Na girlfriend at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.12,0:19:41.95,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,People kept expecting more from \Nme, raising the bar higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.95,0:19:43.86,flashback,IGUCHI,0,0,0,,What? Takuto, you're going \Nto an all-boys school?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.86,0:19:46.43,flashbacktop,OJI,0,0,0,,Huh, yeah. It's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.86,0:19:48.10,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,It was getting harder and \Nharder to be around girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.75,0:19:53.12,flashback italics,OJI,0,0,0,,Senchan_Curry-san uploaded another video.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.86,0:19:57.59,flashback italics,OJI,0,0,0,,Whenever I watch his videos, \Nit makes me crave curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.22,0:20:02.55,flashback italics,OJI,0,0,0,,Actually, wasn't the curry place\Nsomeone showed me near here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.08,0:20:06.52,flashback italics,OJI,0,0,0,,I should go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.44,0:20:13.47,flashback italics,OJI,0,0,0,,That's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.47,0:20:16.60,flashback italics,OJI,0,0,0,,Wow, what is this place? It's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.60,0:20:18.17,flashback italics,OJI,0,0,0,,I'm gonna come here again for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.17,0:20:19.86,flashback,GIRL CUSTOMER 1,0,0,0,,Don't you think that guy's good-looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.11,0:20:21.57,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\b1\fs10\bord0\c&H29517B&\frz5.806\frx350\fry0\pos(285.333,120)}Hiring Part-timers
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.11,0:20:21.57,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\fs10\bord0\c&H295079&\frz5.806\frx350\fry0\pos(286,144.667)}Job position: Floor staff
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.11,0:20:21.57,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\fs8\bord0\c&H27507B&\frz5.806\frx350\fry0\pos(287.666,169.334)}Job Description: Register, customer service, etc.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.11,0:20:21.57,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\fs10\bord0\c&H27507B&\frz5.806\pos(291.333,192)\frx350\fry0}Contact:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.86,0:20:21.57,flashback,GIRL CUSTOMER 2,0,0,0,,Right? So cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.07,0:20:24.38,flashback italics,OJI,0,0,0,,A part-time job, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.05,0:20:40.28,flashback,DAD,0,0,0,,You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.60,0:20:42.26,flashback,YOI,0,0,0,,Sorry, my train was delayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.01,0:20:49.53,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,I think I just stared in awe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.53,0:20:51.68,flashback,GIRL CUSTOMER 1,0,0,0,,That server is super handsome,\N too, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.68,0:20:54.03,flashbacktop,GIRL CUSTOMER 2,0,0,0,,I know, right? He's super hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.23,0:20:55.14,flashback italics,OJI,0,0,0,,A man? That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.93,0:20:58.50,flashback italics,OJI,0,0,0,,Her arms and legs are slightly \Nlonger than most women's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.07,0:21:02.33,flashback italics,OJI,0,0,0,,The soft curve of the back of her neck.\N The delicate fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.78,0:21:04.23,flashback italics,OJI,0,0,0,,The precision of her movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.87,0:21:09.58,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,I honestly thought she \Nwas a beautiful person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.65,0:21:18.06,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,It was only a while later that I \Nrealized it was "love at first sight."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.94,0:21:25.65,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.26,0:21:29.18,flashback,OJI,0,0,0,,I do have someone I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.33,0:21:31.22,flashback,OJI,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,376)\t(376,890,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.84,0:21:34.11,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.67,0:21:36.13,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.56,0:21:39.93,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,likes me?
